        "problem": "Compute the following:\n\n| $[\\begin{aligned}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |",
